<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span id="docs-internal-guid-b4535d87-919c-0420-ac35-a86f63e912c7"><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Are you interested in majoring in communication? Join us for ASU Spotlight West: Communication.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">This special visit for transfer students will give you a deeper dive into our communication majors at Arizona State University’s West campus. Enjoy a campus tour, hear from students and faculty, discover our vibrant Barrett, The Honors College community and enjoy lunch in our Verde Dining Pavilion.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 18.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(153, 0, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Spotlight West: Communication</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Arizona State University, West campus</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Friday, October 30</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Check-in: </span><span style="font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">9:30 – 10 a.m.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Program:</span><span style="font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> 10 a.m. – 1:30 p.m.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">RSVP at <a href="https://visit.asu.edu/spotlightwest"><b><font color="#990000">visit.asu.edu/spotlightwest</font></b></a>.</span></p><br><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">At this event, you will also get to tour the Communication Assessment and Learning Lab (C.A.L.L.). We are one of only 12 institutions in the U.S. that has this type of communication lab.</span></span></div><div><font face="Arial"><span style="font-size: 14.6666669845581px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></font></div><div><span id="docs-internal-guid-b4535d87-919d-a4a9-4013-b3db2b3bbab8"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">If you have any questions, please email </span><a href="mailto:visitASU@asu.edu" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">visitASU@asu.edu</span></a><span style="font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">. If you need a special accommodation, let us know at least two weeks before the event.</span></p><br><span style="font-size: 14.6666666666667px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">We’re looking forward to showing your our communication programs at Spotlight West.</span></span><font face="Arial"><span style="font-size: 14.6666669845581px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></font><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>